==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~6 seconds<sup>30f~180f</sup>.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The first and only strategy (assuming you're still on [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 due to it being extremely easy after that) is spawning as many [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cats]] (or Mythical Titan Cats) whenever you can. Only a Hippoe and a few Jackie Pengs later and you should be done.

